    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Swiss graphic design studio, Zurich and Lucerne, founded by Dorothee Dahler, Kaj Lehmann, Simon Ruegg and Raphael Schoen (met at HSLU Design). Now archived; Instagram bio reads \"Archived projects of former graphic design studio.\" Dahler and Lehmann continue together as Dahler Lehmann (daehlerlehmann.works). Best known for designing Zweikommasieben, a club-culture magazine in MoMA PS1 collection; also designed event posters (Bold series), publications (Akte Zollhaus Luzern, Kaffee-Kreise), exhibition posters (Kunsthalle Basel) and festival materials (Weltformat 2021). praesensbuero.ch renders blank. No LinkedIn found for the studio entity. Email: no public studio email found (studio archived, praesensbuero.ch blank; searched site + IG, none listed). Work Status Studio applies to the org as constituted; founders now work independently/in pairs.",
